      "en": "Is it for your piety that he reproves you, that he enters with you into judgment?",
      "ko": "하나님이 너를 책망하시며 너를 심문하심이 너의 경외함을 인함이냐",
      "source_text_hash": "992581cada4d221675688f3f882fdfa4dc610a21bcbf7f07a2ecbfec23b5f083",
      "translation_text_hash": "7533f26d8a782e310960619073a5c06f26f04298db35a987e108b2254c17382b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
