      "en": "Isn’t your wickedness great? Neither is there any end to your iniquities.",
      "ko": "네 악이 크지 아니하냐 네 죄악이 극하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "6c21cbc6653d2fd2268b139dd82c86c3ff99b43872b016acb47e08c44fbe5b96",
      "translation_text_hash": "0afc6c7b6f929caf5bcaff689f69c8ca0d8970ea6e63acfab5fe4a2286f3e753",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "네 악이 크지 아니하냐 네 죄악이 극하니라"
