        {
          "book": "JOB",
          "chapter": 22,
          "verse": 6
        }
      ],
      "en": "For you have taken pledges from your brother for nothing, and stripped the naked of their clothing.",
      "ko": "까닭 없이 형제의 물건을 볼모 잡으며 헐벗은 자의 의복을 벗기며",
      "source_text_hash": "31feb669703714be7d93f4fddfdf62bc70c50348cbf83a0c4c7db3cbd48ccbd5",
      "translation_text_hash": "7f3b89b6e60120177b5c4f9a241017812dd33cb3a822d7cd588223c22ebdc286",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "까닭 없이 형제의 물건을 볼모 잡으며 헐벗은 자의 의복을 벗기며"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "7f3b89b6e60120177b5c4f9a241017812dd33cb3a822d7cd588223c22ebdc286"
      ]
