      "en": "But as for the mighty man, he had the earth. The honorable man, he lived in it.",
      "ko": "권세 있는 자가 토지를 얻고 존귀한 자가 거기서 사는구나",
      "source_text_hash": "3d0897d88697d0d0e643e5104ee6dcd0b04923bd87f1d792ba80974715593f9c",
      "translation_text_hash": "e0f8496dee09f7dc7ed218e0c58726d4d1b9cd8484174e5560db5e9346b878de",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
